# Raw/rendered media and regenerable staged assets are excluded from version
# control: they are large binaries, regenerated by the HyperFrames workflow
# from source composition files, and video/audio content may include a real
# person's face and voice — keep that off the repo, commit only the
# composition source (storyboard.json, metadata.json, index.html, card HTML).
*.mp4
*.mp3
*.wav
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
/*/public/fonts/
/*/public/vendor/
/*/public/snapshots/
